# Line endings are part of the contract, not a local preference. The App Store
# pins a submission archive by SHA-256 over its exact raw bytes, and Git's own
# autocrlf would rewrite those bytes on a Windows checkout — a digest that
# depends on who checked the repository out pins nothing.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched at all: their bytes ARE the artifact.
*.zip -text
*.tgz -text
